      "Language": "pol",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Adnexal torsion belongs to the group of urgent cases in gynecology Early diagnosis and management can prevent the loss of an ovary and the Fallopian tube. The case of the 14.5-year-old girl was described by the authors. The symptoms were moderate and caused diagnostics problems. During clinical assessment current literature knowledge, differentiation and treatment of the adnexa were taken into account."},
